# Fantasy Refresh — Product Roadmap & Vision
*Bookmarked from planning session — May 2026*

---

## Product Vision

Season-long DFS fantasy football with salary cap, individual kickoff locks, and concurrent game formats. Differentiated from existing platforms by:
- **Individual player kickoff locks** (not whole-week locks)
- **Concurrent guillotine** alongside cumulative or H2H formats
- **Salary cap drafting** every week (not season-long roster management)
- **Multi-format per league** — commissioner chooses format at creation

Target: Public launch July-August 2027. Acquisition target by 2029.

