## League Format Options (2027)

### Cumulative (current)
- Weekly scores sum all season
- Season-long standings
- Playoffs Weeks 15-18

### Head to Head
- Weekly matchups (random or division-based)
- W/L record tracked
- Optional divisions (2-4 divisions per league)
- Playoffs by record + points tiebreaker

### Guillotine (concurrent flag)
- Lowest scorer eliminated each week
- Runs alongside either Cumulative or H2H
- Commissioner sets start week (typically Week 3+)
- Last survivor wins guillotine prize

### Format Combinations
- Cumulative + Guillotine ✅
- H2H + Guillotine ✅
- H2H + Divisions ✅
- H2H + Divisions + Guillotine ✅

