## Commissioner Runbook (Weekly Workflow)

### Tuesday
- Scores lock automatically at 9am ET (GitHub Actions)
- Review any anomalies in commissioner panel
- Scores finalize — standings update

### Wednesday
- Generate salaries for upcoming week (commissioner panel → 💰 Weekly Salaries → Generate)
- Review player pool — refresh if needed (⚡ Refresh button)

### Thursday
- Unlock the week in commissioner panel (lock toggle)
- Draft opens — players can start building lineups
- TNF locks at kickoff automatically

### Friday-Saturday
- International games lock at kickoff automatically
- Monitor commissioner panel for any issues

### Sunday
- 1pm ET games lock automatically
- Scores update live every 5 minutes (GitHub Actions)
- 4:25pm ET games lock
- SNF locks at 8:20pm ET

### Monday
- MNF locks at ~8:15pm ET
- Final scores by midnight ET

### Tuesday 9am ET
- GitHub Actions locks all scores
- Standings finalize
- Cycle repeats

