## Key Decisions Already Made

- Scoring: PPR, 4pt passing TD, standard yardage rates
- Cap: $60,000 | Max: $11,300 | Min: $3,700
- Roster: QB/RB/RB/WR/WR/WR/TE/FLEX/DEF (9 players)
- Lock: Individual player at game kickoff
- Score lock: Tuesday 9am ET
- Data: Tank01 (projections, scoring, schedule) + Sleeper (player pool)
- Hosting: GitHub Pages + Cloudflare Workers + Firebase

